      <h2 class="CH"><a name="14.02"></a>CHAPTER 14-02<br />CIVIL RIGHTS</h2>
            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff14/Flagstaff1402000.html#14.02.001.0001">14-02-001-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Policy Declaration</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff14/Flagstaff1402000.html#14.02.001.0002">14-02-001-0002</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Definitions</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff14/Flagstaff1402000.html#14.02.001.0003">14-02-001-0003</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Prohibited Acts</p>

